### ============================================
### RESTAURANT SERVICE ENDPOINTS
### ============================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@path = /api/v1/zones
@id = 1
@referenceId = 1

### Create a restaurant
### Request Body: ZoneDto
### Response: Created ZoneDto
POST {{baseUrl}}{{path}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Summer Sale",
  "discountType": "PERCENTAGE",
  "amount": 15.00,
  "appliesTo": "CATEGORY",
  "referenceId": 1,
  "startDate": "2024-07-01T00:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2024-07-31T23:59:59Z",
  "isActive": true
}

### Get a restaurant by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: ZoneDto
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
#Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get all restaurants
### Request Body: -
### Response: List<ZoneDto>
GET {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/reference/{referenceId}
#Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Update an existing restaurant
### Request Body: ZoneDto
### Response: Updated ZoneDto
PUT {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Delete a restaurant by ID
### Request Body: -
### Response: No content (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}{{path}}/{id}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json